      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a local setting to manually block navigation to video websites that the person writes in the config․json settings document would improve the VR Chat experience for users who choose to use the setting.\n\nIt would be a useful feature for preventing advertisements on unrelated websites based on videos that were watched through the game\n\n(because of IP based targetting cookies stored on the video websites' servers).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
