      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fcbc96c570ea31a45ec3b87|full_name} Sounds like an awesome idea to me. I’d definitely want to have the ability to add a wildcard though. \n\nThat being said though, couldn’t you simply use the built-in Windows ‘Firewall with Advanced Security’ to make an outbound rule for VRChat specifically? (Or the whole PC, if desired?)\n\nTechnically, you could also just change the HOSTS file for your PC as well, albeit, I know a lot of people may be nervous to do that.",
